{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pulls/137","id":4010057252,"node_id":"PR_kwDOE63pss7vBJ4k","html_url":"https://github.com/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pull/137","diff_url":"https://github.com/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pull/137.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pull/137.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/issues/137","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pulls/137/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pulls/137/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/issues/137/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/statuses/064e6acddc06bbeb912f66f742d8393a6aac8199","number":137,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Barnacles, Kelp, and that one ugly cave plant used outside around Vivec.","user":{"login":"BethOfDeath","id":75344041,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzQ0MDQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75344041?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath","html_url":"https://github.com/BethOfDeath","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Now separated from the simple GH patch bugfix (see #136 for that) per C3pa's request. For v2.1.\r\n\r\nApologies for the deletion of the original PR and having to open a new one -- I accidentally deleted the wrong branch on my repo and it closed the PR. I wasn't sure restoring the branch would allow reopening it, and the Git history was now a little messy, so this seemed the easier solution.\r\n\r\nflora_kelp_01:\r\n- Normals work (duplicated leaves, turned duplicate into convex hull, shade flat, data transferred normals to original).\r\n- Reunwrapped stalk.\r\n- Minor tweaks to base of leaves to prevent clipping through the other side of the stalk.\r\n- Created LOD to reduce to 1 draw call at 4096 and then disappear at 32768.\r\n- NOTE: The latter distance is grossly excessive for vanilla underwater settings, as the murkiness renders the plant invisible beyond ~8000 units! The chosen distance is solely for compatibility purposes, and some further savings can be obtained by changing this.\r\n- Changed NiStringExtraData to NC instead of NCO.\r\n- Vanilla: 9556 bytes; new: 13264. (+39%)\r\n\r\nflora_kelp_02:\r\n- Same as _01\r\n- Vanilla: 9556 bytes; new: 13968. (+46%)\r\n\r\nflora_kelp_03:\r\n- Same as _01\r\n- Minor tweaks to vertex positions of base of branches to hide interior of branches, and moderate sliding to correct major clipping of several branches clear through to the other side of the main stalk.\r\n- Reunwrapped stalk and branches.\r\n- Added LOD1 to reduce from 3 drawcalls to 1 at 4096 and disappear at 16384.\r\n- Vanilla: 14168 bytes; new: 31448 (+122%)\r\n\r\nflora_kelp_04:\r\n- Same as _03, sans the need for fixing clipping\r\n- Vanilla: 14168 bytes; previous MOP: ; new: 24464\r\n\r\nNote for barnacles: I was extremely cautious about deleting faces. Most should be relatively simple to re-add if needed, and none should be visible missing even if the barnacle isn't sunk far enough into the surface of wherever it is used. ex_barnacle_01:\r\n- Minor distortion corrections that are impossible to see in-game anyway.\r\n- Normals work\r\n- Removed 9 hidden triangles from where the three barnacle shells meet (after applying the Weighted Normals modifier, of course)\r\n- Added LOD1 reducing from 2 drawcalls to 1 at 2048 units.\r\n- Added LOD2 reducing from 129 tris to 61 (Insert your own Metal Gear Solid 2 joke here) and disappearing at 16384. (OpenMW 0.5 already culls it around 13k units at default-iirc settings)\r\n- Vanilla: 5416 bytes; new: 11248 (+107%)\r\n\r\nex_barnacle_02:\r\n- Same distortion/normals work as _01.\r\n- Removed 17 hidden triangles\r\n- Added LOD1 reducing from 2 drawcalls to 1 at 2048 units.\r\n- Added LOD2 reducing from 164 tris to 36. (Was less conservative with how much decimation was safe, here.) Same distances.\r\n- Vanilla: 6456 bytes; new: 12542. (+94%)\r\n\r\nex_barnacle_03:\r\n- Same distortion/normals work as _01.\r\n- Removed 47 hidden triangles.\r\n- Added LOD1 as usal.\r\n- Added LOD2 reducing from 313 tris to 92. Same distances.\r\n- Vanilla: 11120 bytes; new: 22698 (+104%)\r\n\r\nex_barnacle_04:\r\n- Same distortion/normals work as _01.\r\n- Removed 15 hidden triangles.\r\n- LOD1 as usual.\r\n- LOD2: reduced from 345 tris to 106.\r\n- Vanilla: 11120 bytes; new: 24286 (+119%)\r\n\r\nex_barnacle_05:\r\n- Same distortion/normals work as _01.\r\n- Removed 8 hidden triangles.\r\n- LOD1 as usual.\r\n- LOD2: reduced from 132 tris to 37.\r\n- Vanilla: 5416 bytes; new: 10564 (+95%)\r\n\r\nex_barnacle_06:\r\n- Same distortion/normals work as _01.\r\n- Removed 5 hidden triangles.\r\n- LOD1 as usual.\r\n- LOD2: reduced from 98 tris to 45.\r\n- Vanilla: 6456 bytes; new: 13004 (+101%)\r\n\r\nin_cave_plant00\r\n- Normals work\r\n- Unified UV islands\r\n- Added LOD1 to reduce from 4 drawcalls to 2, and delete the 18 very thin triangles of the stalk.\r\n- Added LOD2 to drop to 1 drawcall (and lose the alpha tested part of the model entirely).\r\n- Vanilla: 6193 bytes; previous MOP: 5174; new: 10463. (+70% vs vanilla, +102% vs previous MOP)\r\n\r\nfurn_shell00, 10, 20\r\n- This is the same work done for the now-separate kollop size bugfix PR, but of course put in 00 Core and without the GH switch & open versions. Including list of changes here as well, for easy reference.\r\n- Rotated multiple edges to fix shape/normals and eliminate slight self-intersections.\r\n- Normals work.\r\n- Corrected previous issue of not covering the model at all for 00 Core\r\n- 00 Core version: 7171, 6925, and 6925 bytes (Average -7% vs vanilla)","labels":[{"id":10824702333,"node_id":"LA_kwDOE63pss8AAAAChTPZfQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mop-org/morrowind-optimization-patch/labels/2.1","name":"2.1","description":"","color":"E6A995","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-07T21:30:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T07:54:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7079cace31d0265d110ab622a045bdab3caf9c9b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"BethOfDeath:Barnacles_Kelp","ref":"Barnacles_Kelp","repo":{"id":1029141206,"node_id":"R_kgDOPVdy1g","name":"morrowind-optimization-patch","full_name":"BethOfDeath/morrowind-optimization-patch","owner":{"login":"BethOfDeath","id":75344041,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzQ0MDQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75344041?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath","html_url":"https://github.com/BethOfDeath","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BethOfDeath/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription